N5008 [class.friend]/1 + [basic.scope.temp]/2, [basic.scope.class]/1 +
[dcl.meaning.general]/2.3: the friend's name is a namespace member, but its
declaration is looked up in the class -- here the enclosing member class
template's own parameter (as a default template argument) and the class's member
alias.
